    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>MimiCries</i> is a Victorian-inspired, narrative-driven puzzle room game where players investigate the devastated remnants of the tragic Griswald family, and escape from   <br>the horrors of their accursed residence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542110/extras/13f5e005c56057000f51dc5b2ca052ad.poster.avif?t=1751530926\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542110/extras/13f5e005c56057000f51dc5b2ca052ad.webm?t=1751530926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542110/extras/64993081319e78674708f5230789edc2.webp?t=1751530926\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542110/extras/ea494b266627d3b53951e14de61ffe07.poster.avif?t=1751530926\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542110/extras/ea494b266627d3b53951e14de61ffe07.webm?t=1751530926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542110/extras/ea494b266627d3b53951e14de61ffe07.mp4?t=1751530926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawing creatively from the Victorian period, all pixel-art in <i>MimiCries</i> has been meticulously curated to craft time-accurate environments, with astonishing designs that may literally take your breath away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542110/extras/8fa3ed0e6b1baca6ea612069a31c85e1.webp?t=1751530926\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542110/extras/e41804b4bc2d02298782b609efed0284.poster.avif?t=1751530926\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542110/extras/e41804b4bc2d02298782b609efed0284.webm?t=1751530926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542110/extras/e41804b4bc2d02298782b609efed0284.mp4?t=1751530926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emulating your playable character's point-of-view, <i>MimiCries</i> offers a plethora of object<br>and character interactions, which evolve as you make progress with its variety of unique <br>and challenging puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542110/extras/721a80ae664ffbef547b2dab8d6cd0fd.webp?t=1751530926\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542110/extras/c1f70492d7a0623cb76fa114f0bc9667.poster.avif?t=1751530926\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542110/extras/c1f70492d7a0623cb76fa114f0bc9667.webm?t=1751530926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542110/extras/c1f70492d7a0623cb76fa114f0bc9667.mp4?t=1751530926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you traverse the dark rooms and corridors of the Griswald mansion in <i>MimiCries</i>,<br>the light sources you have on hand will both help and hinder your exploration. In the engulfing darkness, will light be the key for your freedom?   <br> <br> <br>All mysteries lay in wait for your unravelling. The Griswald mansion beckons...</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>MimiCries</i> is a Victorian-inspired, narrative-driven puzzle room game where players investigate the devastated remnants of the tragic Griswald family, and escape from   <br>the horrors of their accursed residence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542110/extras/13f5e005c56057000f51dc5b2ca052ad.poster.avif?t=1751530926\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542110/extras/13f5e005c56057000f51dc5b2ca052ad.webm?t=1751530926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542110/extras/64993081319e78674708f5230789edc2.webp?t=1751530926\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542110/extras/ea494b266627d3b53951e14de61ffe07.poster.avif?t=1751530926\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542110/extras/ea494b266627d3b53951e14de61ffe07.webm?t=1751530926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542110/extras/ea494b266627d3b53951e14de61ffe07.mp4?t=1751530926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawing creatively from the Victorian period, all pixel-art in <i>MimiCries</i> has been meticulously curated to craft time-accurate environments, with astonishing designs that may literally take your breath away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542110/extras/8fa3ed0e6b1baca6ea612069a31c85e1.webp?t=1751530926\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542110/extras/e41804b4bc2d02298782b609efed0284.poster.avif?t=1751530926\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542110/extras/e41804b4bc2d02298782b609efed0284.webm?t=1751530926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542110/extras/e41804b4bc2d02298782b609efed0284.mp4?t=1751530926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emulating your playable character's point-of-view, <i>MimiCries</i> offers a plethora of object<br>and character interactions, which evolve as you make progress with its variety of unique <br>and challenging puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542110/extras/721a80ae664ffbef547b2dab8d6cd0fd.webp?t=1751530926\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542110/extras/c1f70492d7a0623cb76fa114f0bc9667.poster.avif?t=1751530926\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542110/extras/c1f70492d7a0623cb76fa114f0bc9667.webm?t=1751530926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542110/extras/c1f70492d7a0623cb76fa114f0bc9667.mp4?t=1751530926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you traverse the dark rooms and corridors of the Griswald mansion in <i>MimiCries</i>,<br>the light sources you have on hand will both help and hinder your exploration. In the engulfing darkness, will light be the key for your freedom?   <br> <br> <br>All mysteries lay in wait for your unravelling. The Griswald mansion beckons...</p>",
